    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627280/extras/e567d60f2e4d9da0071a32c3f157dd4a.avif?t=1754063913\" width=640 height=174 /></span><strong>Harem of Gods is an action roguelite</strong> that sees you, the unlikely hero, face off against the hordes of evil with help from beautiful gods. Plan your item builds, progress your relationships, and massacre the enemies that stand against you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you conquer evil, you form a harem with the gods.</strong> The more justice you serve, the more they want to give you special lewd rewards! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627280/extras/0b2a1276ed57d5dc02d02f71e659f7b3.poster.avif?t=1754063913\" width=614 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627280/extras/0b2a1276ed57d5dc02d02f71e659f7b3.webm?t=1754063913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627280/extras/0b2a1276ed57d5dc02d02f71e659f7b3.mp4?t=1754063913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An ancient evil has decimated the overworld.</strong> But it's not too late to go back. Our hero has been given the curse of undying. His mistake unleashed the spirit of hell that now ravages the earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627280/extras/9e98320fafbb4ece172f24b31abb3c4d.poster.avif?t=1754063913\" width=614 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627280/extras/9e98320fafbb4ece172f24b31abb3c4d.webm?t=1754063913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627280/extras/9e98320fafbb4ece172f24b31abb3c4d.mp4?t=1754063913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every run you dedicate your skills towards one of the gods.</strong> Stay alive, slaughter the hordes, and they'll show you their appreciation by fulfilling your, and their, lewdest desires. Among a variety of gods with many breath-taking animated sex scenes and cute pixel art, you're sure to find what you want! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627280/extras/c9a0ed5fcd8e0e6f541fbc25ccf97387.poster.avif?t=1754063913\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627280/extras/c9a0ed5fcd8e0e6f541fbc25ccf97387.webm?t=1754063913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627280/extras/c9a0ed5fcd8e0e6f541fbc25ccf97387.mp4?t=1754063913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get lost in a rich harem fantasy,</strong> spark a kindling relationship with the lewd gods as you fight to restore the world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adult content created by a team of passionate artists </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 fully animated sex scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautifully animated illustrations of each character  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated infinite maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lewd hordes of sexy enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from many unique items to customize your strategy </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different god abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down unique and some hard to access achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent upgrades as you progress your hero</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired gameplay from our favorite survivor games</p></li></ul>",
